      <title>1 woman killed, another critically injured in Sonoma crash</title>
      <link>https://www.sonomanews.com/2026/02/17/1-woman-killed-another-critically-injured-in-sonoma-crash/</link>
      <description>A 74-year-old Virginia woman remained hospitalized Wednesday in critical but stable condition more than 12 hours after she and another woman were struck by an SUV as they attempted to cross a Sonoma street, officials said. The other victim, a 73-year-old Virginia resident, died Tuesday night from injuries she suffered in the collision.</description>
